     tooltip = "While a CRT is active (before TP1): a chart candle BODY closes beyond the latest chart-TF swing high (bear) / low (bull), then within N bars a candle closes back inside → entry. SL = extreme of the soup, target TP1/TP2.\nUse a chart TF lower than the CRT TF (e.g. 5m–15m for a 1H/4H CRT).")
int  tbsLen   = input.int(3, "Chart swing length", minval = 1, maxval = 10, group = G_ENT)
